{"title":"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/c/55c9a9919e71ee2200dc00dd2f2a02b2a78ce986.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8{3}=p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/c/42c6f9439d3ca9a4b8566da6487916d2244ee241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_3{5}=q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"17\" />, then, in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/e/f4edeafda053cfada185dfd57d71bd743ba86a17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"49\" height=\"17\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/c/65ca728d865220f06fb3354d74361e4fff3a13ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } pq \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }\\frac{3p+q}{5} \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } \\frac{1+3pq}{p+q} \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  } \\frac{3pq}{1+3pq} \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }p^2+q^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"546\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/a/f1a9976d337b187f1f40a38b1080925389f2f4e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{p}=\\log_{3}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" />, so it would probably be easier to work in base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. From change of base, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/7/977bc9d4475a6dc3d77316620ea8bcfc36ae90b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}{5}=\\frac{\\log_{3}{5}}{\\log_{3}{10}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"128\" height=\"42\" />. We're given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/9/f696286284e35876c7fd86cd938f297a006c8d97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{3}{5}=q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"17\" />, so now we just need to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/3/733a6951ebf6f0f771d46648784ff2652ec0e7d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{3}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"17\" />. \n</p><p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/8/d48f0378e1fe2eb1b5ae4d3327708874f813c25d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{p}=\\log_{3}{8}=3\\log_{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"159\" height=\"40\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/1/ba1b7c99a3f90bd891834aa9bfd146f9e40e25bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{3}{2}=\\frac{1}{3p}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"88\" height=\"40\" />. Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/9/8d9e4f1468e195cfa6af7b0ce54666cee61147f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{3}{10}=\\log_{3}{5}+\\log{3}{2}=q+\\frac{1}{3p}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"262\" height=\"40\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/f/17f2fab156a1b501456b2e1662decb16d3a2a4be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}{5}=\\frac{q}{q+\\frac{1}{3p}}=\\frac{3pq}{3pq+1}, \\boxed{\\text{D}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"245\" height=\"46\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME\" title=\"1974 AHSME\">1974 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1974 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1974\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1974 AH